  "method": "Executed official bitmap and Unihex provider load, info and bake methods in a headless JVM. A host stitcher constructs the official BakedSheetGlyph from observed GlyphBitmap bounds with synthetic normalized UV coordinates, no GPU texture/render-type objects, then calls its createGlyph and Styled.render methods. An observing VertexConsumer records transformed vertices, colors and UVs; default VertexConsumer methods execute normally. This bypasses FontTexture.add, atlas allocation, font-set selection, native shaders, blending and the client screen. No game assets/classes or rendered screenshots are included.",
